\f0\b 3. Local Data
\f1\b0 \
\
The App may create, process, or store information locally on your Mac.\
\
Information stored locally by the App remains under your control and is not transmitted to us unless the App specifically provides a feature that requires transmission.\
\
You can remove locally stored App data using the standard macOS mechanisms or the App\'92s available settings.\
\

\f0\b 4. Network Communications
\f1\b0 \
