\

\f0\b 7. Analytics
\f1\b0 \
\
We may use analytics services to understand how the App is used and to improve its functionality. Analytics information may include technical information and general usage events.\
\
We do not intentionally use analytics to identify individual users.\
\

\f0\b 8. Crash Reports and Diagnostics
\f1\b0 \
\
If crash reporting is enabled, diagnostic information may be collected when the App crashes.\
\
Such information may include technical details about the App, operating system, hardware configuration, and the circumstances of the crash.\
\
Crash reports are used solely for purposes such as identifying bugs, improving stability, and maintaining the App.\
\

\f0\b 9. Data Security
\f1\b0 \
\
We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information processed in connection with the App.\
\
However, no method of electronic storage or transmission over the Internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure.\
\

\f0\b 10. Children\'92s Privacy
\f1\b0 \
\
The App is not specifically directed toward children under the age of 13.\
\
We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.\
\
If you believe that a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so that we can take appropriate action.\
\

\f0\b 11. Data Retention
\f1\b0 \
\
We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.\
\
Information stored locally on your Mac may remain there until you delete it or uninstall the App.\
\

